ut a puzzle we'd already half-built — I'll save that for the end and start with everything else. ■ Design ・The puzzles were rebuilt from scratch, once. The original idea was to give every item its own kind of puzzle. Laid out side by side, several ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T15:08:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1840944183778890","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Developer Weekly #6 (Aug 3 – Aug 9)","summary":"Hi, I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio. This is the sixth developer weekly.\\・The first room is fully delivered — from the 3D scene and per-object texturing through to the base art, overlay layer, collision mask, baked light and the other asset layers, plus a set of anchor data for alignment.・We also locked down the room production flow and delivery spec (dimensions, formats, anchors), which the remaining rooms will follow.In a sentence: instead of spreading a dozen rooms out at o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T08:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183778890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1839676055895405","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Developer Weekly #5 (Jul 27 – Aug 2)","summary":"Hi, I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio. This is the fifth developer weekly.\\・Alan's four-directional map sprite now has both the falling and the getting-back-up animations finished.・Next up: Alice's map sprite.・The map pipeline spec is locked. The next step isn't mass production — it's painting one room as the style reference.In a sentence: we make sure one room looks right before producing the rest. What the maps have right now is a spec and a process; the scenes themselves are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T17:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1839041357036516","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Dev Diary #4 (Jul 13 – Jul 26)","summary":"Hi, I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio.This is our fourth dev diary — this time covering two weeks of progress, across four teams.【Story】· Kept pushing the narrative writing for the demo's scope — room dialogue, branching choices, the four-language text, and a close proofing pass on the prologue.A note: this batch of writing isn't locked yet, so no spoilers. All I'll say is that we keep checking one thing — that every line a player reads lands with the right feeling.【Art】(these t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T18:46:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1838407329255735","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Dev Diary #3 (Jul 6 – Jul 12)","summary":"Hi, I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio. This is our third dev diary. Here's last week's progress, across four teams.【Story】· The main script is locked; this week we tightened the dialogue and text for the demo's scope.A note: this stage isn't about adding — it's about polishing lines that are already written until they land, so even the demo's short slice holds its emotional weight.【Art】· Character art is being adjusted around our CG staging plan; the scene-CG pipeline is being r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T05:01:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255735","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1836506165577475","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Dev Diary #2 (Jun 29 – Jul 5)","summary":"Hi everyone — I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio. This is the second dev diary.Here's last week's progress (Jun 29 – Jul 5), reported by team.\\・First pass of detailed script surgery — 15 fixes (flow stitching, unifying wording, lock-version proofing); the producer has reviewed and signed off on each.Notes: Alongside the consistency polish, we went back over every detail of the whole script — not adding things, just making every existing line more precise.\\・Locked in a new standar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T08:37:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2708920-1836506165562704","game_id":"steam-2708920","kind":"announcement","title":"Haunted House — Dev Diary #1 (Jun 22 – 28)","summary":"Hi everyone — I'm Hoppy, producer at Change Entertainment Studio. This is the first dev diary for Haunted House.I'll post an update every Monday so those of you following the game can see how development is actually going.Here's last week's progress (Jun 22 – 28), reported by team.\\・Main scenario advanced to its 6th draft・Finalized seven \"environmental narrative fragments\" (notes scattered through the rooms)・Reworked emotional cues across the entire scriptNotes: To match the new planning and art","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T14:13:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562704","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2708920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2708920":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2708920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z"},"5340670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:21Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2708920","app_id":2708920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"930033a5b7dcee95c5d4be91406f39391f54a34b4fc2a1dfc4068954b7b46302","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You wake up in an eerie mansion, beside the one you love. To take her home, you face six lost souls — not enemies, but tragedies to understand. Each room hides a love never spoken. But when you think you've finally escaped, some truths only appear once you walk out the door.","publishers":[{"name":"改變娛樂工作室","creator_clan_account_id":46180258}],"developers":[{"name":"改變娛樂工作室","creator_clan_account_id":46180258},{"name":"哈皮"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"comin